#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Check out two Qiskit addons, [Shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) and [Propagated noise absorption](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna), which are built on top of this execution model.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"המלצות\">\n"
"- בדוק שני Qiskit addons, [Shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) ו-[Propagated noise absorption](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna), שנבנו על גבי מודל הרצה זה.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
